🧠 Field Engine API

Ψ_unk.initialize

Initializes the unknown‑state field.

Signature:

Ψ_unk.initialize(domain, clusters, variance)

Parameters:

domain — simulation region Ω

clusters — list of initial cluster centers rᵢ

variance — Gaussian σ

Returns:A fully initialized unknown‑state field tensor.

Ψ_unk.update

Evolves the field by one timestep using the unknown‑matter operator.

Signature:

Ψ_unk.update(L_unk, Δt)

Parameters:

L_unk — evolution operator

Δt — timestep

Returns:Updated field state Ψ_unk(t + Δt).

