🔁 Autonomous Loop API

Engine.step

Executes one full sovereign timestep.

Signature:

Engine.step(Δt)

Process:

Update Ψ_unk

Extract topology

Validate topology

Generate key

Gate structure

Output Φ(t + Δt)

Returns:Stable structure Φ(t + Δt) or null.

Engine.run

